# �T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T
# BOS Pipeline v9.0 �� Environment Variables (Example)
# �T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T�T
#
# Copy to .env and fill in your values:
#   cp .env.example .env

# ���� Application ����
APP_NAME="BOS Pipeline"
APP_VERSION="9.0.0"
ENVIRONMENT=development
DEBUG=true
LOG_LEVEL=INFO

# ���� Database ����
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://bos:bos_secret@localhost:5432/bos_pipeline

# ���� Redis ����
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0

# ���� Celery ����
CELERY_BROKER_URL=redis://localhost:6379/1
CELERY_RESULT_BACKEND=redis://localhost:6379/2

# ���� JWT Secrets (CHANGE THESE IN PRODUCTION!) ����
JWT_SECRET_KEY=change-me-to-a-random-32-char-string!!
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET_KEY=change-me-refresh-32-char-string-too!
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=30
JWT_REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRE_DAYS=7

# ���� CORS ����
CORS_ORIGINS=["http://localhost:5173","http://localhost:3000"]

# ���� Feature Flags ����
FF_ENABLE_MONTE_CARLO=true
FF_ENABLE_DIGITAL_TWIN=true
FF_ENABLE_AUTOML=false
FF_ENABLE_WEBSOCKET=true
FF_ENABLE_EXPORT_PARQUET=true
FF_ENABLE_BILLING=true
FF_ENABLE_MULTI_LANGUAGE=false
FF_ENABLE_DARK_MODE=true

# ���� Rate Limiting ����
RATE_LIMIT_ENABLED=true

# ���� Email (optional) ����
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=noreply@bos-pipeline.io
# SMTP_PASSWORD=secret

# ���� Object Storage (optional) ����
# S3_ENDPOINT=https://s3.amazonaws.com
# S3_BUCKET=bos-pipeline-exports
# S3_ACCESS_KEY=AKIA...
# S3_SECRET_KEY=...
